> explain (verbose, costs off)
> select q.b from (select y.b, y.a from a23_sj y) q join a23_i4 i on q.a = i.f1
QUERY PLAN:text
Hash Join
  Output: y.b
  Inner Unique: true
  Hash Cond: (i.f1 = y.a)
  ->  Seq Scan on public.a23_i4 i
        Output: i.f1
  ->  Hash
        Output: y.b, y.a
        ->  Seq Scan on public.a23_sj y
              Output: y.b, y.a
-- EXPLAIN

> explain (costs off)
> select t1.a, (select a from a23_sj where a = t2.a and a = t1.a) from a23_sj t1, a23_sj t2 where t1.a = t2.a
QUERY PLAN:text
Seq Scan on a23_sj t2
  Filter: (a IS NOT NULL)
  SubPlan 1
    ->  Result
          One-Time Filter: (t2.a = t2.a)
          ->  Seq Scan on a23_sj
                Filter: (a = t2.a)
-- EXPLAIN

